'''Snowman''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is frosted in thick ice, which is overlaid by a layer of snowfall. The guard is white, and the handle is bright blue with a snowman imprinted on it, hence the name.

==Trivia ==
*It has a [[Snowman Gun (2015)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Snowman_Set Snowman Set].

